#
# rpcd backend for nym-vpn LuCI interface.
#
# All methods are served by the Rust bridge (`nym-vpnc rpcd`): typed gRPC to
# the daemon, JSON out, with daemon-independent system methods (init.d, uci,
# split-tunnel regen) implemented natively. This file exists only because
# rpcd discovers plugins as executables in /usr/libexec/rpcd/. History: the
# former ~2000-line shell implementation here scraped nym-vpnc's
# human-readable output with per-line awk/sed pipelines — hundreds of forks
# per request — which made gateway loading time out on slow routers.
exec /usr/bin/nym-vpnc rpcd "$@"
